      "cooked": "<p>The latest Kickstarter update includes copies of the miniature prototypes.&nbsp;</p><p>http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/galactic-strike-force-the-cooperative-deck-buildin/posts/539686?ref=email&amp;show_token=89a61ec901e153f9</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Does the dragon seem a bit underwhelming? I know that without the base it is hard to pose it properly, but even taking that into account it seems much less impressive than, say, the spider.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just saying...</p>",
