      "created_at": "2013-07-15T23:26:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh yeah, it looks like they changed the way the dragon looks from <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/E1gw9Jm.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the earlier pix</a>.&nbsp; Looks like maybe it doesn't have any arms or legs now.&nbsp; They also simplified the Singularity model quite a bit, and the legs on the spider in this prototype are more splayed out (flatter to the ground) than in the earlier pic.&nbsp; Guess they couldn't get the earlier models to work properly?</p>",
