      "created_at": "2014-01-19T18:10:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The pix in the <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/content/major-january-2014-update\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">latest update</a>&nbsp;got me excited about pulling out my old brushes again for some mini painting. &nbsp;But when I pulled out the old utility box and took a look, I saw a box full of dried up paint bottles. &nbsp;Has it really been so long? &nbsp;Maybe my once-solid painting skills have dried up too, after so many years. &nbsp;Now I'm a little nervous about painting the minis...</p>",
